# Generated by `make demo`. The DuckDB database and the Delta tables are large and
# regenerable, so they stay out; `reports/` is committed on purpose — the plan, the
# ledger and the charts are what people read on GitHub without cloning, and CI gates
# the plan against the code that produced it.
